{# Issue #66: points out objects nobody is responsible for, and links straight into the filter
   that lists them.

   Responsibility is the organising idea of this tool, yet "what is nobody responsible for?" was
   the one question it could not answer — a gap you can only find by opening every record is a gap
   nobody finds. The banner is what turns "findable" into "visible without asking".

   Shown to ISB and admin only; the controller hands over null for everyone else and also when
   nothing is unassigned, so there is no leftover "0 objects" banner.

   Not an alert-warning on purpose: an unowned object is a gap to close, not a fault to fix, and
   it must not compete visually with the source-health warning above it.

   Variables:
   - unassigned: hash with `total` plus ONLY those of vulnerabilities/software/asset_groups the
     viewer may actually open — a figure without a usable list would link into an unexplained
     empty page (#67), so the controller leaves those keys out entirely. Never null here.
#}
<div class="alert alert-info mb-3" role="status">
    <div class="d-flex">
        <div>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                 fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
                 stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon alert-icon me-2" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M8 7a4 4 0 1 0 8 0a4 4 0 0 0 -8 0"/>
                <path d="M6 21v-2a4 4 0 0 1 4 -4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2"/>
                <path d="M19 7h-4"/>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h2 class="alert-title h4">
                {{ 'dashboard.unassigned.title'|trans({'%count%': unassigned.total}) }}
            </h2>
            <div class="text-secondary">
                {{ 'dashboard.unassigned.body'|trans }}
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {% if unassigned.vulnerabilities|default(0) > 0 %}
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary"
                       href="{{ path('app_vulnerability_index', {'assignee': 'unassigned', 'status': 'active'}) }}">
                        {{ 'dashboard.unassigned.link_vulnerabilities'|trans({'%count%': unassigned.vulnerabilities}) }}
                    </a>
                {% endif %}
                {% if unassigned.software|default(0) > 0 %}
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary"
                       href="{{ path('app_software_index', {'assignee': 'unassigned', 'filter': 'active'}) }}">
                        {{ 'dashboard.unassigned.link_software'|trans({'%count%': unassigned.software}) }}
                    </a>
                {% endif %}
                {% if unassigned.asset_groups|default(0) > 0 %}
                    <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary"
                       href="{{ path('app_asset_group_index', {'assignee': 'unassigned', 'status': 'active'}) }}">
                        {{ 'dashboard.unassigned.link_asset_groups'|trans({'%count%': unassigned.asset_groups}) }}
                    </a>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
